 CI_PB_PRIM_GET_IDENTITY_REQ , /**< \brief \details NOT SUPPORTED REMOVE FROM API */	 
 CI_PB_PRIM_GET_IDENTITY_CNF , /**< \brief \details NOT SUPPORTED REMOVE FROM API */	 
