 CI_CC_PRIM_LOCALCB_NOTIFY_IND , /**< \brief \details NOT SUPPORTED REMOVE FROM API */	 
 CI_CC_PRIM_GET_ACM_VALUE_REQ , /**< \brief Requests the current value of the accumulated call meter ( ACM )	 
