 * SMS_DELIVER , SMS_SUBMIT_REPORT , and SMS_STATUS_REPORT messages , as	 
 * specified in TS 23.040000 ( section 9.200000 .3.24.2 Special SMS Message Indication ) and	 
 * TS 23.038000 ( section 4 . SMS Data Coding Scheme ) . Where disagreement occurs , TP_UDH	 
